# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF line endings, on every
# platform. CI runs on windows-latest, where git's default converts to CRLF
# on checkout; prettier's `endOfLine: "lf"` then fails every file, and every
# CI step after the format check is skipped. Found 2026-09-22 — CI had not run
# past the format check since it was introduced.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.node binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
